{"seq":2,"slug":"threading-and-workers","title":"Wasm 线程与 Web Workers 协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/web-integration/threading-and-workers","wordCount":869,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"wasm-线程与-web-workers-协作\">Wasm 线程与 Web Workers 协作</h1><p>WebAssembly 的线程提案将 Wasm 从单线程计算引擎提升为真正的并行计算平台。通过 SharedArrayBuffer 支撑的共享线性内存和原子操作指令，多个 Worker 中的 Wasm 实例可以并发读写同一块内存——这正是 C++ 的 pthreads、Rust 的 rayon 等多线程库在浏览器中工作的基础。本篇深入线程模型的架构、同步原语和实战模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Wasm 多线程基于三个基础设施：SharedArrayBuffer（多 Worker 共享同一块内存）、Wasm 原子指令（<code>atomic.load</code>/<code>store</code>/<code>rmw</code>/<code>wait</code>/<code>notify</code>）、Cross-Origin Isolation 安全前提（COOP + COEP 响应头）。Emscripten 的 pthreads 和 Rust 的 rayon 建立在这套机制之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"架构总览\">架构总览</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;主线程&quot;&#10;        A[Main Thread&lt;br/&gt;UI + 协调]&#10;        B[SharedArrayBuffer&lt;br/&gt;共享内存]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Worker 1&quot;&#10;        C[Wasm Instance 1&lt;br/&gt;共享同一 Memory]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Worker 2&quot;&#10;        D[Wasm Instance 2&lt;br/&gt;共享同一 Memory]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;Worker N&quot;&#10;        E[Wasm Instance N&lt;br/&gt;共享同一 Memory]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; C&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    C -.-&gt;|atomic ops| D&#10;    D -.-&gt;|atomic ops| E\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"主线程\"\n        A[Main Thread&lt;br/&gt;UI + 协调]\n        B[SharedArrayBuffer&lt;br/&gt;共享内存]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Worker 1\"\n        C[Wasm Instance 1&lt;br/&gt;共享同一 Memory]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Worker 2\"\n        D[Wasm Instance 2&lt;br/&gt;共享同一 Memory]\n    end\n    subgraph \"Worker N\"\n        E[Wasm Instance N&lt;br/&gt;共享同一 Memory]\n    end\n    A --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; C\n    B --&gt; D\n    B --&gt; E\n    C -.-&gt;|atomic ops| D\n    D -.-&gt;|atomic ops| E</pre><p>关键机制：所有 Worker 中的 Wasm 实例共享同一个 <code>WebAssembly.Memory</code>（backed by SharedArrayBuffer），每个实例独立执行指令，通过原子操作同步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置条件-cross-origin-isolation\">前置条件：Cross-Origin Isolation</h2><p>Wasm 线程依赖 SharedArrayBuffer（SAB），而 SAB 在 Spectre 缓解后需要 cross-origin isolation：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin&#10;Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>COOP: same-origin</td>\n<td>页面不能被跨域窗口引用</td>\n<td><code>window.opener</code> 失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>COEP: require-corp</td>\n<td>所有子资源需 CORP/CORS 头</td>\n<td>第三方无头资源被阻止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>crossOriginIsolated === true</code></td>\n<td>两个头都正确设置</td>\n<td>SAB 可用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>缺少这两个头，<code>SharedArrayBuffer</code> 构造器会抛出异常，Wasm 线程无法工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"创建共享内存\">创建共享内存</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 创建共享内存（必须声明 shared: true）&#10;const memory = new WebAssembly.Memory({&#10;  initial: 256, // 256 页 = 16MB&#10;  maximum: 65536, // 最大 4GB&#10;  shared: true, // 关键：启用共享&#10;});&#10;&#10;// memory.buffer 现在是 SharedArrayBuffer&#10;console.log(memory.buffer instanceof SharedArrayBuffer); // true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 创建共享内存（必须声明 shared: true）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> memory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  initial: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 256 页 = 16MB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maximum: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">65536</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 最大 4GB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shared: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 关键：启用共享</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// memory.buffer 现在是 SharedArrayBuffer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(memory.buffer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">instanceof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SharedArrayBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// true</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"向-worker-分发模块\">向 Worker 分发模块</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// main.js&#10;const module = await WebAssembly.compileStreaming(fetch(&#39;/parallel.wasm&#39;));&#10;const memory = new WebAssembly.Memory({ initial: 256, maximum: 4096, shared: true });&#10;&#10;const workers = Array.from({ length: navigator.hardwareConcurrency }, () =&gt; {&#10;  const w = new Worker(&#39;wasm-worker.js&#39;);&#10;  w.postMessage({ module, memory }); // Module 和 Memory 可 postMessage&#10;  return w;&#10;});&#10;&#10;// wasm-worker.js&#10;self.onmessage = async ({ data: { module, memory } }) =&gt; {&#10;  const instance = await WebAssembly.instantiate(module, {&#10;    env: { memory },&#10;  });&#10;  // 此 instance 与其他 Worker 共享同一块内存&#10;  instance.exports.parallel_work(self.workerId, totalWorkers);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// main.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> module</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">compileStreaming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/parallel.wasm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> memory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ initial: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, maximum: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, shared: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> workers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: navigator.hardwareConcurrency }, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Worker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wasm-worker.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  w.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">postMessage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ module, memory }); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Module 和 Memory 可 postMessage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// wasm-worker.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">self.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onmessage</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> instance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">instantiate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    env: { memory },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 此 instance 与其他 Worker 共享同一块内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  instance.exports.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parallel_work</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self.workerId, totalWorkers);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"同步原语\">同步原语</h2><h3 id=\"mutex-互斥锁\">Mutex（互斥锁）</h3><p>Wasm 原子指令可实现无锁 spinlock 或基于 wait/notify 的阻塞锁：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wat\" data-code=\";; 简单 spinlock（适合短临界区）&#10;(func $lock (param $addr i32)&#10;  (block $done&#10;    (loop $spin&#10;      ;; 尝试 CAS: 0 → 1&#10;      (i32.atomic.rmw.cmpxchg (local.get $addr) (i32.const 0) (i32.const 1))&#10;      (i32.eqz)&#10;      (br_if $done)&#10;      ;; 未获得锁，自旋&#10;      (br $spin))))&#10;&#10;(func $unlock (param $addr i32)&#10;  (i32.atomic.store (local.get $addr) (i32.const 0))&#10;  ;; 唤醒一个等待者&#10;  (memory.atomic.notify (local.get $addr) (i32.const 1))&#10;  (drop))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>;; 简单 spinlock（适合短临界区）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(func $lock (param $addr i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (block $done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (loop $spin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ;; 尝试 CAS: 0 → 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (i32.atomic.rmw.cmpxchg (local.get $addr) (i32.const 0) (i32.const 1))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (i32.eqz)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (br_if $done)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ;; 未获得锁，自旋</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (br $spin))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(func $unlock (param $addr i32)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (i32.atomic.store (local.get $addr) (i32.const 0))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ;; 唤醒一个等待者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (memory.atomic.notify (local.get $addr) (i32.const 1))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (drop))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"futex-wait-notify\">Futex（wait/notify）</h3><p>对于长时间等待，spinlock 浪费 CPU。<code>memory.atomic.wait</code> 让线程真正挂起：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>返回值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>memory.atomic.wait32(addr, expected, timeout)</code></td>\n<td>若 <code>*addr == expected</code> 则挂起线程</td>\n<td>0=唤醒, 1=未匹配, 2=超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>memory.atomic.notify(addr, count)</code></td>\n<td>唤醒 count 个等待在 addr 的线程</td>\n<td>实际唤醒数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意：<code>memory.atomic.wait</code> <strong>不能在主线程调用</strong>（会抛异常），只能在 Worker 中使用。主线程如需等待，必须用 <code>Atomics.waitAsync</code>（JS 层面）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"emscripten-pthreads-映射\">Emscripten pthreads 映射</h2><p>Emscripten 将 POSIX pthreads API 映射为 Web Workers + SharedArrayBuffer：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"#include &lt;pthread.h&gt;&#10;#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;&#10;&#10;void* thread_func(void* arg) {&#10;    int id = *(int*)arg;&#10;    printf(&quot;Thread %d running\\n&quot;, id);&#10;    return NULL;&#10;}&#10;&#10;int main() {&#10;    pthread_t threads[4];&#10;    int ids[4] = {0, 1, 2, 3};&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; 4; i++) {&#10;        pthread_create(&amp;threads[i], NULL, thread_func, &amp;ids[i]);&#10;    }&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; 4; i++) {&#10;        pthread_join(threads[i], NULL);&#10;    }&#10;    return 0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;pthread.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;stdio.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> thread_func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> arg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)arg;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    printf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Thread </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> running</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    pthread_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> threads</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> ids</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        pthread_create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">threads</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, thread_func, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ids</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        pthread_join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">threads</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译时启用线程支持：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"emcc main.c -O2 -s USE_PTHREADS=1 -s PTHREAD_POOL_SIZE=4 -o main.js\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">emcc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main.c</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -O2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> USE_PTHREADS=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> PTHREAD_POOL_SIZE=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main.js</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Emscripten 会预创建 Worker 池（<code>PTHREAD_POOL_SIZE</code>），每个 <code>pthread_create</code> 从池中取 Worker 而非新建（新建 Worker 是异步的，无法直接映射同步的 <code>pthread_create</code> 语义）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"rust-rayon-在-wasm-中的使用\">Rust rayon 在 Wasm 中的使用</h2><p>Rust 的 rayon 库通过 <code>wasm-bindgen-rayon</code> 适配器在浏览器中工作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use rayon::prelude::*;&#10;use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn parallel_sum(data: &amp;[f64]) -&gt; f64 {&#10;    data.par_iter().sum()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use rayon::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn parallel_sum(data: &#x26;[f64]) -> f64 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data.par_iter().sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import init, { parallel_sum, initThreadPool } from &#39;./pkg/my_lib.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;await init();&#10;await initThreadPool(navigator.hardwareConcurrency);&#10;&#10;const data = new Float64Array(10_000_000).map(() =&gt; Math.random());&#10;const sum = parallel_sum(data); // 自动并行\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> init, { parallel_sum, initThreadPool } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './pkg/my_lib.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> initThreadPool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(navigator.hardwareConcurrency);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float64Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parallel_sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自动并行</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"性能对比\">性能对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>单线程 Wasm</th>\n<th>4 线程 Wasm</th>\n<th>加速比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>矩阵乘法 (1024x1024)</td>\n<td>850ms</td>\n<td>230ms</td>\n<td>3.7x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图像模糊 (4K)</td>\n<td>120ms</td>\n<td>35ms</td>\n<td>3.4x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光线追踪 (720p)</td>\n<td>2400ms</td>\n<td>650ms</td>\n<td>3.7x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JSON 解析 (10MB)</td>\n<td>45ms</td>\n<td>45ms（不可并行）</td>\n<td>1.0x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>并行加速比通常达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.8</mn><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.8N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为核心数），略低于理论线性加速——这是因为 Worker 创建开销、原子操作竞争和内存带宽共享。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与最佳实践\">陷阱与最佳实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主线程调用 <code>wait</code></td>\n<td>抛出 TypeError</td>\n<td>只在 Worker 中 wait</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过细粒度锁</td>\n<td>原子操作竞争导致性能退化</td>\n<td>批量处理，减少锁次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未设 COOP/COEP</td>\n<td>SAB 不可用，线程失败</td>\n<td>服务器正确设置头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Worker 池过小</td>\n<td>线程创建阻塞</td>\n<td><code>PTHREAD_POOL_SIZE</code> 预分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据竞争</td>\n<td>未定义行为（虽然 Wasm 不 crash）</td>\n<td>所有共享访问用原子操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Wasm 线程基于 SharedArrayBuffer 实现共享内存多线程</li>\n<li>Cross-Origin Isolation（COOP + COEP）是线程工作的硬性前提</li>\n<li>原子操作 + wait/notify 实现互斥锁和条件变量</li>\n<li>Emscripten 将 pthreads 映射为 Worker 池，rayon 通过适配器并行化</li>\n<li>典型场景可获得 3-4 倍加速（4 核），但受内存带宽和同步开销限制</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"js-wasm-interop\">JS-Wasm 互操作</a>：内存交互与跨边界调用的基础</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../frontend-web-workers-parallelism/messaging/shared-array-buffer\">SharedArrayBuffer 与原子操作详解</a>：SAB 的底层机制与 Atomics API 完整参考</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Wasm 线程与 Web Workers 协作","id":"wasm-线程与-web-workers-协作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"架构总览","id":"架构总览"},{"level":2,"text":"前置条件：Cross-Origin Isolation","id":"前置条件-cross-origin-isolation"},{"level":2,"text":"创建共享内存","id":"创建共享内存"},{"level":3,"text":"向 Worker 分发模块","id":"向-worker-分发模块"},{"level":2,"text":"同步原语","id":"同步原语"},{"level":3,"text":"Mutex（互斥锁）","id":"mutex-互斥锁"},{"level":3,"text":"Futex（wait/notify）","id":"futex-wait-notify"},{"level":2,"text":"Emscripten pthreads 映射","id":"emscripten-pthreads-映射"},{"level":2,"text":"Rust rayon 在 Wasm 中的使用","id":"rust-rayon-在-wasm-中的使用"},{"level":2,"text":"性能对比","id":"性能对比"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与最佳实践","id":"陷阱与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"JavaScript 与 WebAssembly 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/web-integration/js-wasm-interop"},"next":{"title":"浏览器生产案例与框架集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/web-integration/browser-use-cases"}}